  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "數值方法與分析",
    "sub_ename": "NUMERICAL METHOD AND ANALYSIS",
    "describe_ch": "介紹可在電腦上完成數值計算用來解根、線性代數方程式、曲線配合、積分、微分方程式和特徵值等工程與科學問題的方法。內容主要著力於方法的選擇與應用，而不是方法的推導。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is intended as an introduction to techniques for carrying out numerical computation on computers to solve roots, linear algebraic equations, curve fitting, integration, differential equations, and eigenvalues problems in engineering and science. Contents are more concerned with the choice and application of techniques than with the derivation of the methods.",
    "pre_subname": "MATH1001微積分(一)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "MATH1001",
    "pre_sub_ename": "MATH1001 CALCULUS(1)",
